<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia official reserves fall $39.6 mln in Jan.</title>
<headline>Slovenia official reserves fall $39.6 mln in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (in millions of dollars)	   Jan	  Dec     Jan 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves		     3,925.9    4,096.1   2,839.1</p>
<p>    Bank of Slovenia reserves	2,239.1    2,278.7   1,440.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as whole. -- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
